urname><given-names>S.</given-names></name> <source>Biosci. Biotechnol. Biochem.</source> <year>2001</year>, <volume>65</volume>, 2657&#x02013;2665.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11826961</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>